      "content": "the \"recovery\" thing is just... it's not realistic. my advisor already has such high expectations and i can't bear the thought of that look on their face when i tell them it's all garbage. i feel like i've wasted years of my life for nothing. it feels like there's just this huge, empty void where my whole life was supposed to be. i can't see a single version of the future that isn't just shame and failure.",
